--  Partition-wide configuration pragmas.
--
--  Jorvik (Ada 2022, RM D.13) is the concurrency profile this runtime is
--  built against.  Compared with Ravenscar it keeps the hard guarantees
--  (library-level tasks only, no task termination, ceiling locking,
--  FIFO_Within_Priorities, static CPU assignment) while allowing the two
--  things this design needs: protected entry queues longer than one, and
--  relative delays.
pragma Profile (Jorvik);

--  SPARK RM 9(2): a partition containing tasking must elaborate
--  sequentially, so every library unit is elaborated before any task is
--  activated.  Without this, gnatprove rejects all tasking constructs.
pragma Partition_Elaboration_Policy (Sequential);
